{%- comment -%}
  Russian mobile drawer (DDS-Foundations redesign). Rendered from _includes/header_ru.html.
  The English drawer stays in _includes/header-mobile.liquid and is untouched.

  .header__sidebar, .header__sidebar--nav, .menu-item-has-children and .sub-menu-container
  are kept so adaptive/header-mobile.js keeps driving the burger, the accordion and the
  cloning of the documentation sidebar without any change.

  No language toggle here - the design has none, and language-switch.js no-ops without it.

  Products and Solutions are hardcoded here on purpose. The API feed still sends a
  "Produkty" top-level item, which header-menu-fill-items.html skips by title, and it
  sends no "Resheniya" item at all. The Russian list is the five products the design
  ships brand marks for.
{%- endcomment -%}
